{"data":{"id":"7rrVOspw7iq","name":"Thông tin khách hàng","activeVersion":1,"versions":[{"id":"4l6Xg2OfGBM","version":1,"code":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n    <title>ThôngTinKháchHàng</title>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\" />\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin />\n    <link\n      href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@100;200;300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap\"\n      rel=\"stylesheet\"\n    />\n    <link\n      href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@100;200;300;400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap\"\n      rel=\"stylesheet\"\n    />\n    <link\n      href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap\"\n      rel=\"stylesheet\"\n    />\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/3.0.0/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <style type=\"text/tailwindcss\">\n      @theme inline {\n        --color-background: var(--background);\n        --color-foreground: var(--foreground);\n        --color-primary: var(--primary);\n        --color-primary-foreground: var(--primary-foreground);\n        --color-secondary: var(--secondary);\n        --color-secondary-foreground: var(--secondary-foreground);\n        --color-muted: var(--muted);\n        --color-muted-foreground: var(--muted-foreground);\n        --color-accent: var(--accent);\n        --color-accent-foreground: var(--accent-foreground);\n        --color-destructive: var(--destructive);\n        --color-card: var(--card);\n        --color-card-foreground: var(--card-foreground);\n        --color-popover: var(--popover);\n        --color-popover-foreground: var(--popover-foreground);\n        --color-border: var(--border);\n        --color-input: var(--input);\n        --color-ring: var(--ring);\n        --color-chart-1: var(--chart-1);\n        --color-chart-2: var(--chart-2);\n        --color-chart-3: var(--chart-3);\n        --color-chart-4: var(--chart-4);\n        --color-chart-5: var(--chart-5);\n\n        --font-font-sans: var(--font-sans);\n        --font-font-heading: var(--font-heading);\n        --font-font-serif: var(--font-serif);\n        --font-font-mono: var(--font-mono);\n      }\n\n      @theme {\n        --radius-xs: calc(var(--radius) - 8px);\n        --radius-sm: calc(var(--radius) - 4px);\n        --radius-md: calc(var(--radius) - 2px);\n        --radius-lg: var(--radius);\n        --radius-xl: calc(var(--radius) + 4px);\n        --radius-2xl: calc(var(--radius) + 8px);\n        --radius-3xl: calc(var(--radius) + 16px);\n        --radius-4xl: calc(var(--radius) + 24px);\n      }\n\n      * {\n        corner-shape: var(--shape, round);\n      }\n\n      .rounded-full,\n      .rounded-none,\n      .rounded-t-full,\n      .rounded-t-none,\n      .rounded-r-full,\n      .rounded-r-none,\n      .rounded-b-full,\n      .rounded-b-none,\n      .rounded-l-full,\n      .rounded-l-none,\n      .rounded-s-full,\n      .rounded-s-none,\n      .rounded-e-full,\n      .rounded-e-none,\n      .rounded-tl-full,\n      .rounded-tl-none,\n      .rounded-tr-full,\n      .rounded-tr-none,\n      .rounded-bl-full,\n      .rounded-bl-none,\n      .rounded-br-full,\n      .rounded-br-none,\n      .rounded-ss-full,\n      .rounded-ss-none,\n      .rounded-se-full,\n      .rounded-se-none,\n      .rounded-es-full,\n      .rounded-es-none,\n      .rounded-ee-full,\n      .rounded-ee-none {\n        corner-shape: round;\n      }\n\n      @utility rounded-* {\n        border-radius: calc(\n          --value(--radius-*, [length], [percentage]) * var(--shape-multiplier, 1)\n        );\n      }\n      @utility rounded-t-* {\n        border-top-left-radius: calc(\n          --value(--radius-*, [length], [percentage]) * var(--shape-multiplier, 1)\n        );\n        border-top-right-radius: calc(\n          --value(--radius-*, [length], [percentage]) * var(--shape-multiplier, 1)\n        );\n      }\n      @utility rounded-r-* {\n        border-top-right-radius: calc(\n          --value(--radius-*, [length], [percentage]) * var(--shape-multiplier, 1)\n        );\n        border-bottom-right-radius: calc(\n          --value(--radius-*, [length], [percentage]) * var(--shape-multiplier, 1)\n        );\n      }\n      @utility rounded-b-* {\n        border-bottom-right-radius: calc(\n          --value(--radius-*, [length], [percentage]) * var(--shape-multiplier, 1)\n        );\n        border-bottom-left-radius: calc(\n          --value(--radius-*, [length], [percentage]) * var(--shape-multiplier, 1)\n        );\n      }\n      @utility rounded-l-* {\n        border-top-left-radius: calc(\n          --value(--radius-*, [length], [percentage]) * var(--shape-multiplier, 1)\n        );\n        border-bottom-left-radius: calc(\n          --value(--radius-*, [length], [percentage]) * var(--shape-multiplier, 1)\n        );\n      }\n      @utility rounded-tl-* {\n        border-top-left-radius: calc(\n          --value(--radius-*, [length], [percentage]) * var(--shape-multiplier, 1)\n        );\n      }\n      @utility rounded-tr-* {\n        border-top-right-radius: calc(\n          --value(--radius-*, [length], [percentage]) * var(--shape-multiplier, 1)\n        );\n      }\n      @utility rounded-bl-* {\n        border-bottom-left-radius: calc(\n          --value(--radius-*, [length], [percentage]) * var(--shape-multiplier, 1)\n        );\n      }\n      @utility rounded-br-* {\n        border-bottom-right-radius: calc(\n          --value(--radius-*, [length], [percentage]) * var(--shape-multiplier, 1)\n        );\n      }\n      @utility rounded-s-* {\n        border-start-start-radius: calc(\n          --value(--radius-*, [length], [percentage]) * var(--shape-multiplier, 1)\n        );\n        border-end-start-radius: calc(\n          --value(--radius-*, [length], [percentage]) * var(--shape-multiplier, 1)\n        );\n      }\n      @utility rounded-e-* {\n        border-start-end-radius: calc(\n          --value(--radius-*, [length], [percentage]) * var(--shape-multiplier, 1)\n        );\n        border-end-end-radius: calc(\n          --value(--radius-*, [length], [percentage]) * var(--shape-multiplier, 1)\n        );\n      }\n      @utility rounded-ss-* {\n        border-start-start-radius: calc(\n          --value(--radius-*, [length], [percentage]) * var(--shape-multiplier, 1)\n        );\n      }\n      @utility rounded-se-* {\n        border-start-end-radius: calc(\n          --value(--radius-*, [length], [percentage]) * var(--shape-multiplier, 1)\n        );\n      }\n      @utility rounded-es-* {\n        border-end-start-radius: calc(\n          --value(--radius-*, [length], [percentage]) * var(--shape-multiplier, 1)\n        );\n      }\n      @utility rounded-ee-* {\n        border-end-end-radius: calc(\n          --value(--radius-*, [length], [percentage]) * var(--shape-multiplier, 1)\n        );\n      }\n\n      :root {\n        --shape: squircle;\n        --shape-multiplier: 1;\n\n        --background: #f8f9fb;\n        --foreground: #0f172a;\n        --primary: #4338ca;\n        --primary-foreground: #ffffff;\n        --secondary: #e2e8f0;\n        --secondary-foreground: #1e293b;\n        --muted: #f1f5f9;\n        --muted-foreground: #64748b;\n        --accent: #eef2ff;\n        --accent-foreground: #4338ca;\n        --destructive: #ef4444;\n        --card: #ffffff;\n        --card-foreground: #0f172a;\n        --popover: #ffffff;\n        --popover-foreground: #0f172a;\n        --border: #e2e8f0;\n        --input: #f8f9fb;\n        --ring: #4338ca;\n        --chart-1: #0ea5e9;\n        --chart-2: #1877f2;\n        --chart-3: #10b981;\n        --chart-4: #ec4899;\n        --chart-5: #0f172a;\n\n        --font-sans: \"Inter\";\n        --font-heading: \"Inter\";\n        --font-serif: \"Playfair Display\";\n        --font-mono: \"JetBrains Mono\";\n\n        --radius: 1rem;\n      }\n\n      @supports (corner-shape: squircle) {\n        :root {\n          --shape-multiplier: 2.5;\n        }\n      }\n\n      /* Prevent layout shift for icons without explicit dimensions */\n      iconify-icon:not([width]):not([height]) {\n        display: inline-block;\n        width: 1em;\n        height: 1em;\n      }\n\n      /* Hide scrollbars */\n      *,\n      *::before,\n      *::after {\n        scrollbar-width: none;\n        -ms-overflow-style: none;\n      }\n      *::-webkit-scrollbar {\n        display: none;\n      }\n    </style>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col min-h-screen bg-background text-foreground font-sans relative\">\n      <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-foreground/10 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n      <div\n        class=\"relative mt-20 flex-1 bg-card rounded-t-[2rem] shadow-2xl border-t border-border flex flex-col overflow-hidden\"\n      >\n        <div class=\"sticky top-0 bg-card z-10 pt-3 pb-1\">\n          <div class=\"w-10 h-1.5 bg-muted-foreground/20 rounded-full mx-auto mb-4\"></div>\n          <div class=\"px-6 flex items-center justify-between mb-6\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold font-heading tracking-tight\">Chi tiết khách hàng</h2>\n            <button\n              type=\"button\"\n              class=\"size-8 rounded-full bg-muted flex items-center justify-center\"\n            >\n              <iconify-icon\n                icon=\"solar:close-circle-linear\"\n                class=\"text-muted-foreground\"\n                width=\"24\"\n                height=\"24\"\n              ></iconify-icon>\n            </button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto px-6 pb-12 space-y-8\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-start gap-5\">\n            <div class=\"relative shrink-0\">\n              <img\n                alt=\"User\"\n                src=\"https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/women/44.jpg\"\n                class=\"size-20 rounded-squircle object-cover shadow-md border-2 border-white\"\n              />\n              <div\n                class=\"absolute -bottom-1 -right-1 size-7 rounded-squircle bg-white shadow-sm border border-border flex items-center justify-center\"\n              >\n                <iconify-icon\n                  icon=\"simple-icons:zalo\"\n                  class=\"text-[#0EA5E9]\"\n                  width=\"16\"\n                  height=\"16\"\n                ></iconify-icon>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex-1 space-y-1\">\n              <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-foreground\">Nguyễn Thu Hà</h3>\n              <div class=\"space-y-1.5\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">\n                  <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:phone-linear\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></iconify-icon\n                  ><span>090 123 4567</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">\n                  <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:letter-linear\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></iconify-icon\n                  ><span>thuha.nguyen@gmail.com</span>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"grid grid-cols-4 gap-3\">\n            <button class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2 group\">\n              <div\n                class=\"size-12 rounded-2xl bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-primary transition-colors group-hover:text-white border border-primary/20\"\n              >\n                <iconify-icon\n                  icon=\"solar:phone-calling-linear\"\n                  width=\"24\"\n                  height=\"24\"\n                ></iconify-icon>\n              </div>\n              <span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-center uppercase tracking-tight\"\n                >Gọi điện</span\n              ></button\n            ><button class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2 group\">\n              <div\n                class=\"size-12 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-emerald-500 transition-colors group-hover:text-white border border-emerald-100\"\n              >\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:hand-stars-linear\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></iconify-icon>\n              </div>\n              <span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-center uppercase tracking-tight\"\n                >Tạo cơ hội</span\n              ></button\n            ><button class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2 group\">\n              <div\n                class=\"size-12 rounded-2xl bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-blue-500 transition-colors group-hover:text-white border border-blue-100\"\n              >\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:user-speak-linear\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></iconify-icon>\n              </div>\n              <span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-center uppercase tracking-tight\"\n                >Chuyển KH</span\n              ></button\n            ><button class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2 group\">\n              <div\n                class=\"size-12 rounded-2xl bg-muted text-foreground flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-secondary transition-colors border border-border\"\n              >\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:user-plus-linear\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></iconify-icon>\n              </div>\n              <span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-center uppercase tracking-tight\">Gán NV</span>\n            </button>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n            <div class=\"bg-muted/40 p-3 rounded-2xl border border-border/50\">\n              <p class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\">\n                Nguồn khách\n              </p>\n              <p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground\">Zalo Ads (Hè 2024)</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"bg-muted/40 p-3 rounded-2xl border border-border/50\">\n              <p class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\">\n                Chủ sở hữu\n              </p>\n              <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                <img\n                  alt=\"Owner\"\n                  src=\"https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/men/32.jpg\"\n                  class=\"size-4 rounded-full\"\n                /><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground\">Nguyễn Tuấn Kiệt</span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"space-y-3\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n              <h4 class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground\">\n                Nhãn hội thoại\n              </h4>\n              <button class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-primary flex items-center gap-1\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:add-circle-linear\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></iconify-icon\n                >Thêm nhãn\n              </button>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">\n              <span\n                class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 text-xs font-bold border border-indigo-100 flex items-center gap-1.5\"\n                ><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-bold\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\"></iconify-icon>Khách\n                hàng VIP</span\n              ><span\n                class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-muted text-foreground/70 text-xs font-bold border border-border flex items-center gap-1.5\"\n                >Gia đình</span\n              ><span\n                class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 text-xs font-bold border border-amber-100 flex items-center gap-1.5\"\n                >Quan tâm iPhone 15</span\n              >\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"space-y-3\">\n            <h4 class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground\">\n              Cơ hội đang mở (2)\n            </h4>\n            <div class=\"space-y-2.5\">\n              <div\n                class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-white shadow-sm flex items-center justify-between\"\n              >\n                <div class=\"space-y-1\">\n                  <h5 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-foreground\">Mua iPhone 15 Pro Max 256GB</h5>\n                  <p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">\n                    Giai đoạn: <span class=\"text-primary font-bold\">Đàm phán</span>\n                  </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"text-right\">\n                  <p class=\"text-sm font-bold text-foreground tabular-nums\">34.990.000đ</p>\n                  <p class=\"text-[10px] text-muted-foreground\">Cập nhật 2h trước</p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <div\n                class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-white shadow-sm flex items-center justify-between\"\n              >\n                <div class=\"space-y-1\">\n                  <h5 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-foreground\">Gói bảo hành vàng 2 năm</h5>\n                  <p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">\n                    Giai đoạn: <span class=\"text-emerald-600 font-bold\">Báo giá</span>\n                  </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"text-right\">\n                  <p class=\"text-sm font-bold text-foreground tabular-nums\">2.500.000đ</p>\n                  <p class=\"text-[10px] text-muted-foreground\">Cập nhật Hôm qua</p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n            <h4 class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground\">\n              Hoạt động gần đây\n            </h4>\n            <div class=\"space-y-6 relative ml-2\">\n              <div class=\"absolute left-[7px] top-2 bottom-2 w-0.5 bg-muted\"></div>\n              <div class=\"relative flex gap-4 pl-6\">\n                <div\n                  class=\"absolute left-0 top-1 size-4 rounded-full bg-primary border-4 border-white shadow-sm ring-1 ring-primary/20\"\n                ></div>\n                <div class=\"space-y-1\">\n                  <p class=\"text-sm text-foreground leading-snug\">\n                    <span class=\"font-bold\">Kiệt Nguyễn</span> đã cập nhật giai đoạn cơ hội lên\n                    <span class=\"text-primary font-bold\">Đàm phán</span>\n                  </p>\n                  <p class=\"text-[10px] text-muted-foreground\">Hôm nay · 14:30</p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"relative flex gap-4 pl-6\">\n                <div\n                  class=\"absolute left-0 top-1 size-4 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 border-4 border-white shadow-sm ring-1 ring-emerald-500/20\"\n                ></div>\n                <div class=\"space-y-1\">\n                  <p class=\"text-sm text-foreground leading-snug\">\n                    <span class=\"font-bold\">Khách hàng</span> đã xem báo giá qua Zalo\n                  </p>\n                  <p class=\"text-[10px] text-muted-foreground\">Hôm nay · 12:15</p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"relative flex gap-4 pl-6\">\n                <div\n                  class=\"absolute left-0 top-1 size-4 rounded-full bg-muted-foreground border-4 border-white shadow-sm ring-1 ring-muted-foreground/20\"\n                ></div>\n                <div class=\"space-y-1\">\n                  <p class=\"text-sm text-foreground leading-snug\">\n                    Cuộc gọi đi từ <span class=\"font-bold\">Kiệt Nguyễn</span> (2 phút 15 giây)\n                  </p>\n                  <p class=\"text-[10px] text-muted-foreground\">Hôm qua · 16:45</p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </body>\n</html>\n","createdAt":"2026-08-03T02:51:12.224599+00:00"}],"createdAt":"2026-08-03T02:51:12.224599+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-08-03T02:51:12.224599+00:00"}}